    {
      "id": 252466,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-05-02T17:03:58.348Z",
      "cooked": "<p>YAY FASHION YAY</p>\n<p>He’s sounding pretty good for someone with a ‘compromised’ voice. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>\n<p>I’m glad the first thing they went to was the first thing I thought of, bringing back an old character from the Stylin’ Shirley days. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>I now choose to believe Fashion has a run fighting Spite.</p>\n<p>“I must have your knees in a jar” is definitely the most villain modus operandi of all time.</p>\n<p>Wow, you can’t say they don’t go all out for this podcast.</p>\n<p>Can’t wait for Christopher to hit 40 and start developing inexplicable health issues! :’)</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2023-05-02T17:03:58.348Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
