      "raw": "YAY FASHION YAY\n\nHe's sounding pretty good for someone with a 'compromised' voice. :P\n\nI'm glad the first thing they went to was the first thing I thought of, bringing back an old character from the Stylin' Shirley days. :D\n\nI now choose to believe Fashion has a run fighting Spite.\n\n\"I must have your knees in a jar\" is definitely the most villain modus operandi of all time.\n\nWow, you can't say they don't go all out for this podcast.\n\nCan't wait for Christopher to hit 40 and start developing inexplicable health issues! :')",
