      "cooked": "<p>I’m being mildly silly, of course, but fair enough (mostly just latching onto them saying very clearly that Fashion isn’t in <em>the next</em> set, which isn’t the same as saying she won’t have a deck).  Also we have to expect Young Legacy to show up at some point here, since she was confirmed early on as a separate deck and we’ve seen her nemesis badge already.</p>",
