      "cooked": "<p>Oh, I don’t remember the exact discussion – this was years ago, I think it was during the Kickstarter for the initial DE set. As I remember, there was a question about whether there would be a Young Legacy in the box, and Christopher said something along the lines of “After a lot of consideration we decided that she deserves her own deck”.</p>\n<p>Iron Legacy’s nemesis badge kinda confirms that, though there’s a small possibility that Felicia could be a Legacy variant with a different icon. But as I remember one of the reasons they wanted to split the two Legacies up was because father/daughter teamups aren’t uncommon in the comics but that’s impossible when they share a deck.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2023-05-03T17:51:45.578Z",
