      "created_at": "2023-05-03T19:19:07.017Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Great episode, and interesting that the wandering star turned out to get resolved this quickly! I thought it was going to end up being an RPG-era thing.</p>\n<p>Although the discussion about Fashion being from 19<em>coughcough</em> and no one discussing her early adventures <em>really</em> makes me wonder how the metaverse handles Legacy. Maybe I should write in a question about that. Actually, yes, definitely I should.</p>",
